WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Freelancers lose money and time to late payments and awkward follow-up emails.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
First, I upload the signed proposal. InvoicePilot reads the agreed payment schedule.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
It creates the invoices on the schedule from the proposal: deposit, midpoint and delivery.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Polite reminders go out until the client pays, and they stop as soon as payment lands.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
It connects to Stripe and QuickBooks, so payments reconcile without double entry.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
It's 19 dollars a month, cancel anytime. Create your first invoice schedule.
